<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Alex. Brown ups Lucent to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Alex. Brown ups Lucent to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown &amp; Sons analyst Chris Crespi raised his rating on Lucent Technologies Inc to buy from market perform, the brokerage said.</p>
<p>The analyst was not immediately availble to comment on the upgrade.</p>
<p>Earlier Wednesday, the company reported net income for the third quarter ended June 30 of $0.33 per share, triple that of the year-ago quarter and well above the First Call consensus expectation of $0.25 per share.</p>
<p>((-- Eric Auchard, New York newsdesk, 212-859-1712))</p>
